Package: com.wifitether
Name: WiFi Tether
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Section: Networking
Depends: firmware (>= 15.0)
Recommends: com.rostane.share, python3
Maintainer: WiFi Tether
Author: WiFi Tether
Homepage: https://github.com/scog3/iOS-WiFi-tether
Icon: https://scog3.github.io/iOS-WiFi-tether/icon.png
SileoDepiction: https://scog3.github.io/iOS-WiFi-tether/depiction.json
Depiction: https://scog3.github.io/iOS-WiFi-tether/depiction.html
Description: Share the iPhone's Wi-Fi connection with a computer over USB, through the iPhone's VPN when one is connected. One switch turns Personal Hotspot on and keeps Wi-Fi connected. Needs Personal Hotspot to be available (for example with the Share tweak). Installing it adds the Share tweak's repo (aminerostane.com/repo) to Sileo if it isn't there. python3 is only used to restart a VPN that iOS stopped.
